      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Loyalty Day Parade will be held Saturday, April 30, 1966, starting at 1:00 P.M. It is requested that all Departments and Agencies cooperate with the Parade Chairman, Michael J. Caslin, Veterans of Foreign Wars of the United States of America, 238 William Street, New York, New York, to promote the participation of City employees.",
